WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.750
Step five tries wave two, Tier
0, before wave one is done.

2
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.320
Five roles, nine findings, five
warnings and two information items,

3
00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:13.225
and the run is blocked: fix
every finding before the apply.

4
00:00:13.225 --> 00:00:15.593
The nine findings are pim oh seven,

5
00:00:15.593 --> 00:00:19.313
one for each Tier 1 role that
doesn't match its file yet.

6
00:00:19.313 --> 00:00:23.562
The two Info rows are the emergency
accounts, kept permanent active.

7
00:00:23.562 --> 00:00:26.187
Step six applies wave one to the fake.

8
00:00:26.187 --> 00:00:31.338
The first command stops before any write:
the plan sets an authentication context,

9
00:00:31.338 --> 00:00:36.488
so confirm its Conditional Access policy
is On, then pass Activation Gate Checked.

10
00:00:36.488 --> 00:00:38.287
The second command passes it.

11
00:00:38.287 --> 00:00:42.892
It sends the rule updates first and
the eligibility requests second,

12
00:00:42.892 --> 00:00:47.738
fifty-one requests, then reads back:
zero differences from the role files.

13
00:00:47.738 --> 00:00:51.170
Step seven runs the tests,
three hundred thirty pass,

14
00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:53.380
and you delete the output folder.
